# 📊 Sales Performance Dashboard

> **Transforming raw sales data into actionable business insights.**

An interactive Business Intelligence dashboard built using **Python, Streamlit, Pandas and Plotly**. Analyze sales performance, monitor KPIs, explore regional trends and visualize business insights through an intuitive dashboard.

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.x-blue?logo=python)
![Streamlit](https://img.shields.io/badge/Streamlit-Dashboard-red?logo=streamlit)
![Pandas](https://img.shields.io/badge/Pandas-Data%20Analysis-150458?logo=pandas)
![Plotly](https://img.shields.io/badge/Plotly-Visualization-3F4F75?logo=plotly)
![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Completed-success)

---

## 🚀 Project Overview

The Sales Performance Dashboard converts raw sales CSV files into meaningful visual insights.

Users can upload their own datasets or explore built-in demonstration data, apply dynamic filters, monitor key performance indicators and download filtered records.

## ✨ Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| 📁 CSV Upload | Upload custom sales datasets |
| 📈 KPI Cards | Track sales, profit, orders and profit margin |
| 📊 Interactive Charts | Explore five dynamic Plotly visualizations |
| 🔍 Smart Filters | Filter by date, region and category |
| 🧹 Data Cleaning | Automatic validation and preprocessing |
| 📋 Data Explorer | View filtered records |
| 📥 CSV Export | Download filtered datasets |
| 🎨 Custom UI | Clean interface with a consistent light theme |

## 📊 Dashboard Analytics

The dashboard includes five interactive visualizations:

1. **Monthly Sales Trend** – Analyze revenue over time.
2. **Sales by Category** – Compare product category performance.
3. **Sales by Segment** – Understand customer segment contributions.
4. **Sales by Region** – Compare geographical sales performance.
5. **Profit by Category** – Identify the most profitable categories.

